        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 35 Wilton Road is a semi-detached 5-bedroomed house in Wilton, Cork City and has come to market with the adjoining property No 36.  These two properties may be of interest to investors.\r\n\r\nNo 35 & No 36 Wilton Road are adjacent semi-detached houses in a prime location near C.U.H, Bons Secour Hospital, U.C.C., and Wilton Shopping Center. The houses are independent residential rental properties.\r\n\r\nBoth properties have a similar accommodation layout:\r\nGround Floor: Hallway, Living Room, Dining Area, Kitchen, Bathroom, 1 Bedroom, \r\nFirst Floor: 4 Bedroom, Bathroom.\r\nSee floorplans for full details. \r\n\r\nThese rental properties are a superb investment opportunity with large front gardens with extensive parking and rear gardens with side access. Located just a 5-minute walk to CUH and a 10-minute walk to UCC and Bons Secours Hospital these properties are ideally suited for the student and professional rental markets. \r\n\r\nPassing Rent: \r\nDunreeth,  35 Wilton Road, Cork: €2,080.80 per month\r\nBellevista, No 36 Wilton Road, Cork: €1,875.84 per month. \r\nProperties will be sold with vacant possession.  \r\n\r\nBER CERTIFICATE\r\nNo 35 Wilton Road: BER: F 105506133\r\nNo 36 Wilton Road: BER:  E 103431474"
      },
